{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48221","headline":"又嘲杨文瓘 · 刘行敏","name":"又嘲杨文瓘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"武陵敬爱客，终宴不知疲。\n遣共浑王饮，错宴延陀儿。\n始被鸿胪识，终蒙御史知。\n精神既如此，长叹复何爲。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘行敏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_48221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_48221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}